tion] The target video is a short live-action comedy skit set in a hospital consultation room. <Subject 1>, the male doctor whose identity comes from <Picture 1>, asks <Subject 2>, the young woman patient whose identity comes from <Picture 2>, what is wrong. The doctor fetches an ice cube from a small refrigerator under his desk, places it in the patient's hand, and the exchange ends with the patient's awkward laugh. The two referenced images guide only the characters' facial identity, hair, and wardrobe.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): partially_preserved - the facial identity and short black hair from <Picture 1> are fully retained, while the reference sheet's plain T-shirt and jeans outfit is adapted into a white medical coat worn over the same T-shirt and jeans to suit the hospital setting.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 2], [Shot 4], [Shot 5]): fully_preserved - the patient's facial identity, high ponytail, white fitted tank top, blue flared jeans, and light high-heel sandals are all retained as shown in <Picture 2>.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a realistic live-action style with bright, clean clinical lighting and a slightly warm color palette.\n[Shot 1] A medium-wide shot frames the interior of a hospital consultation room: a white examination desk with a computer monitor, a medical cabinet against the wall, and a small white refrigerator tucked under the desk. <Subject 1>, the young East Asian male doctor with short neat black hair from <Picture 1>, sits behind the desk in a white medical coat over his white round-neck T-shirt and light-blue jeans. Across the desk, <Subject 2>, the young woman with a high ponytail, white fitted tank top, blue flared jeans, and light high-heel sandals from <Picture 2>, sits on the patient chair with her hands in her lap. The camera holds a static shot as the doctor (S1) looks up and asks in a calm, slightly formal tone, <d>[Chinese] 哪里不舒服？</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the shot cuts to a medium close-up of <Subject 2> (S2), who shifts in her chair, fans her face with one hand, and answers in an embarrassed, lightly playful voice, <d>[Chinese] 我有点热，需要降降火。</d> She lowers her hand, gives a sheepish smile, and lets out a short breath.\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.000, the shot cuts to a wider shot of <Subject 1> (S1) behind the desk. He nods with a helpful expression and says, <d>[Chinese] 过来我来帮你吧。</d> He leans down, opens the small refrigerator door under the desk, reaches inside, and pinches a small clear ice cube between his fingertips, then straightens up holding it.\n[Shot 4] At 00:11.000, the shot cuts to a close-up of <Subject 1>'s hand placing the ice cube into <Subject 2>'s open palm, the cube glinting under the fluorescent light. The camera tilts up slightly to <Subject 1> (S1), who looks at her and asks, <d>[Chinese] 还热吗？</d> <Subject 2> (S2) stares wide-eyed at the ice cube in her hand, momentarily speechless.\n[Shot 5] At 00:13.000, the shot cuts to a medium close-up of <Subject 2> (S2), who gives a stiff, strained awkward laugh with a tight smile while the ice cube melts and drips water between her fingers. She holds it stiffly away from her body as the frame ends.\n\noverall_soundscape: A quiet air-conditioned hospital room tone with a faint ventilation hum continues throughout. The patient chair scrapes, the mini-fridge door clicks open, and the ice cube clinks softly against the patient's palm, followed by slow water dripping.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A light comedic pizzicato string and glockenspiel motif at a moderate tempo, with a soft rising flourish landing on the punchline and a quick fade-out at the end.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [210, 360], "pos": [-289.2777099609375, 5515.70166015625], "id": 195,